Prism Heights is a neighbourhood of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], on the better side of middle income. [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Detective Ellis Brooks|Detective Ellis Brooks]] kept a fifth-floor studio in a six-story brownstone here, up five flights of stairs, past a locked front door with buzzers and no doorman. The studio is cramped: an entry hall opening onto one room with a couch, a Murphy bed, a desk by the windows that look out over the city, a kitchenette and a bathroom.
